#. type: YAML Front Matter: title
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable Basic authentication"
msgstr "ベーシック認証の有効化"

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid ""
"Enable Basic authentication to require a username and password before users can access your Quarkus application.\n"
"For more information, see xref:security-basic-authentication.adoc[Basic authentication]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid ""
"You have installed at least one extension that provides an `IdentityProvider` to verify username and password credentials and map them to a `SecurityIdentity`.\n"
"For example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid "xref:security-jpa.adoc[Quarkus Security Jakarta Persistence extensions (`quarkus-security-jpa` or `quarkus-security-jpa-reactive`)]"
msgstr "xref:security-jpa.adoc[Quarkus セキュリティー Jakarta 永続性エクステンション (`quarkus-security-jpa` または `quarkus-security-jpa-reactive`)]"

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid "xref:security-properties.adoc[Elytron security properties file extension `(quarkus-elytron-security-properties-file)`]"
msgstr "xref:security-properties.adoc[Elytron セキュリティープロパティーファイルエクステンション `(quarkus-elytron-security-properties-file)`]"

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid "xref:security-jdbc.adoc[Elytron security JDBC extension `(quarkus-elytron-security-jdbc)`]"
msgstr "xref:security-jdbc.adoc[Elytron セキュリティー JDBC エクステンション `(quarkus-elytron-security-jdbc)`]"

#. type: Title =
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "手順"

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid "In the `application.properties` file, set the `quarkus.http.auth.basic` property to `true`."
msgstr "`application.properties` ファイルで、`quarkus.http.auth.basic` プロパティーを `true` に設定します。"

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid ""
"Configure an identity provider to verify the username and password against your user store.\n"
"For a production application, configure one of the identity provider extensions listed in the Prerequisites, for example, by storing users in a database with the Jakarta Persistence extension.\n"
"For more information, see the xref:security-identity-providers.adoc[Identity providers] guide."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid "*For testing only:* In a non-production environment, you can use the embedded realm provided by the `quarkus-elytron-security-properties-file` extension instead of a production identity provider."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid "To enable authentication for the embedded realm, set the `quarkus.security.users.embedded.enabled` property to `true`."
msgstr "埋め込みレルムの認証を有効にするには、`quarkus.security.users.embedded.enabled` プロパティーを `true` に設定します。"

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid ""
"You can also configure the required user credentials: user name, password, and roles.\n"
"For example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid "where:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid "The user, `alice`, has `alice` as their password and `admin` as their role."
msgstr "ユーザー `alice` のパスワードは `alice`、ロールは `admin` です。"

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid "The user, `bob`, has `bob` as their password and `user` as their role."
msgstr "ユーザー `bob` のパスワードは `bob`、ロールは `user` です。"

#. type: Title =
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "検証"

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid "Start your application."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid "Send a request to a secured endpoint _without_ credentials and confirm that the application returns a `401 Unauthorized` response:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-basic-authentication-howto.adoc
msgid "Send the same request _with_ a valid username and password and confirm that the application returns a `200 OK` response:"
msgstr ""

